# Templates Directory Index

Ready-to-use templates for rapid code generation and scaffolding. All templates include placeholders for customization and follow project standards.

## Organization

```
templates/
├── astro/          # Astro framework templates
├── content/        # Content templates
├── generic/        # Universal templates
└── issues/         # Issue templates
```

---

