## Astro Templates

### Component Template (`astro/component-template.astro.mdx`)

**Purpose:** Create new Astro components with proper TypeScript typing and structure.

**Includes:**

- Props interface definition
- TypeScript strict typing
- Scoped styles section
- Accessibility attributes
- SEO-friendly markup
- Component documentation

**When to Use:**

- Creating reusable UI components
- Building design system elements
- Implementing interactive components

**Placeholders:**

- `ComponentName` - PascalCase component name
- `description` - Component purpose
- Props definitions

**Token Estimate:** 150 tokens

**Related:**

- `rules/astro/components/component-architecture.mdx`
- `snippets/astro/component-patterns.md`
- `rules/generic/code-quality/typescript.mdx`

